\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \s42 \rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\lang1046\langfe1033\langfenp1033\insrsid11668386\charrsid11668386 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 179.\tab}Inicia sua defesa acerca das considera\'e7\'f5
